{"id":"n61329-1-13","stage":1,"title":"사전 · 辞典","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61329-1-13-1","ko":"영어 신문을 읽는데 모르는 단어가 너무 많아.","zh":"我正在读英文报纸，里面有太多不认识的单词了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영어","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语。","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}},{"text":"신문을","meaning":"报纸","explanation":"신문：报纸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"신문","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65337","senseId":"1","lemma":"신문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신문을","audio":"/audio/6df29ec2c4ff64e3ac1d.mp3"}},{"text":"읽는데","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽는데","audio":"/audio/0bde86d5a0dbb7eacc8e.mp3"}},{"text":"모르는","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르는","audio":"/audio/5c899f629e78903f85b0.mp3"}},{"text":"단어가","meaning":"单词，词汇","explanation":"단어：单词，词汇；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"단어","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57287","senseId":"1","lemma":"단어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단어가","audio":"/audio/ea9cbbec543dc8ac6916.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많아.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아","audio":"/audio/cddc8e9fac3b225d8a31.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a37f8fdb58ccaa0","term":"영어","zh":"英语","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3","entryId":"28241","definition":"英国和美国等国家使用的世界上使用范围最广的语言。","pronunciation":["영어"]},{"id":"bcf27ef578d25dc7","term":"신문","zh":"报纸","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3","entryId":"65337","definition":"告知世上新发生的事件的定期刊物。","pronunciation":["신문"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"bc97e79178e9c607","term":"단어","zh":"单词，词汇","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3","entryId":"57287","definition":"具有一定的意义和功能、可单独被使用的最小的语言单位。","pronunciation":["다너"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0235540e5d1726bc4c05.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61329-1-13-2","ko":"사전에서 찾아보면 되지.","zh":"去词典里查一下不就得了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사전에서","meaning":"辞典，词典","explanation":"사전：辞典，词典；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"사전","audio":"/audio/7b67a8962fe34d193c29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61329","senseId":"1","lemma":"사전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사전에서","audio":"/audio/33427ef366831a20e448.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아보면","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아보면","audio":"/audio/f4e9d90cb0874adda92a.mp3"}},{"text":"되지.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되지","audio":"/audio/507870f39c91f2c2ef24.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7b67a8962fe34d19","term":"사전","zh":"辞典，词典","audio":"/audio/7b67a8962fe34d193c29.mp3","entryId":"61329","definition":"按一定次序将词语汇集整理以说明其发音、 含义、 词源、 用法等的书籍。","pronunciation":["사전"]},{"id":"a3eafbcd1004a6ce","term":"찾아보다","zh":"查找，翻找","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3","entryId":"29758","definition":"为了得到想要的信息而仔细观察。","pronunciation":["차자보다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0d7bbb38ecf30e4abcbf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61329","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.4201,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["去词典里查一下不就得了。","从早上开始就忙个不停，可还是没卖出去多少东西啊。","我正在读英文报纸，里面有太多不认识的单词了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["去词典里查一下不就得了。","我正在读英文报纸，里面有太多不认识的单词了。","从早上开始就忙个不停，可还是没卖出去多少东西啊。"],"answer":0}]}
